After Phase 1 context gathering, spawn specialized testing agents mapped to OWASP WSTG categories based on the gathered intelligence:
- Spawn an **Authentication Testing Agent (ATHN)** for login handlers, JWT logic, session management
- Spawn an **Authorization Testing Agent (ATHZ)** for access control, RBAC, IDOR-prone endpoints
